		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>Je n&#039;y arrive pas :-(</p><p>Voici la commande que je tape :<br />c:\PTRS_BDD\synchromanuelle\2011-1-26&gt;C:\APPLI_BDD\PostgreSql\bin\psql.exe -U postgres base_test -f synchro.backup</p><p>Mais ca retourne une erreur:<br />psql: warning: extra command-line argument &quot;-f&quot; ignored<br />psql: warning: extra command-line argument &quot;synchro.backup&quot; ignored psql (8.4.4)<br />WARNING: Console code page (850) differs from Windows code page (1252)<br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;8-bit characters might not work correctly. See psql reference<br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;page &quot;Notes for Windows users&quot; for details.<br />Type &quot;help&quot; for help.</p>]]></content>
